exG/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Cfn7SkTsaOlc3VCSSeguecB7X4u7KvYN/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nBlue ribbon fox theme\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tJLSLWnjpOpWGedx64-todP5P44FusXt\n\nViolin cover of blue ribbon fox theme\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1imxh3Jdlb9iF7i-3d2UBOBQT2KzL0NkG\n\nIf the original character theme is not suitable to make music from. I wonder if you can use the theme of another battle song from another music request I asked!\n\nFox girl battle theme \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jB8PWFlB9d1PX9yONXCqCLgqnQYBOH0y\n\nAnd if neither theme is usable. A new theme is fine. \n\nIf there are instruments that you can not play, I understand. I will only ask that you do your best!\n\nI do not expect a very long song. So please do not feel pressured to create a long music track!\n\nIf you would like to use any of the music provided in the reference links for the song. It is okay! \n\nSorry for rambling, and thank you for your time!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 413796, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "たからっく［U］", "screen_name": "mawaruyoworld", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1774818797033340928/1BsezGaF.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2362778150/1690956873/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "music"}], "banned": false, "nc": 16}, {"id": 745015, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ああああ", "screen_name": "q07a_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2061606306814005248/VZ_yeBH7.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1943923532/1635